# Verse 1, 16 bars. Source is in G; transposed to C.

chords:
| C | F C | F C / G7 | C | C / F C | F C | Dm / C D7 | G |
| C | F C | C G7 / C | G | G7 / C F | C G Am F | C G7 | C |

melody:
A-bide with me; fast falls the e-ven-tide;
E4(2) E4 D4 C4(2) G4(2) A4 G4 G4 F4 E4(4)
the dark-ness deep-ens; Lord, with me a-bide.
E4(2) F4 G4 A4(2) G4(2) F4 D4 E4 F#4 G4(4)
When oth-er help-ers fail and com-forts flee,
E4(2) E4 D4 C4(2) G4(2) G4 F4 F4 E4 D4(4)
help of the help-less, O a-bide with me.
D4(2) E4 F4 E4 D4 C4 F4 E4(2) D4(2) C4(4)
